        "params": {
          "text": "PREDATOR_PREY_FASTER_GROWTH\nprey'=1.5*prey-0.5*prey*predator; predator'=0.5*prey*predator-predator; initial (4,1).\nRun 40 model seconds at 4000 Hz. Double-click Scope and phase viewers.\nEquations, experiments and numerical limits: examples/lotka_volterra/README.md.\nState at step k represents (k-1)*dt; observation label is k*dt.\nExperimental teaching model; manual Studio workflow remains unqualified.",
